{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["dynamoi:read","dynamoi:mcp.full"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Create the same unpaid Stripe Checkout the dashboard's Add campaign funds button creates, in the artist's bound currency, and return its URL for the user to open and pay. Call it first WITHOUT confirm to get the exact amount and currency; show both to the user and obtain their explicit approval, then call again with confirm=true, that currency, the same amountMinor and the same requestId (retrying within 24 hours returns the same session; once a payment exists for that requestId, or after a day, use a new requestId). This never charges anyone or records a deposit: dynamoi_get_billing reports the exact deposit outcome in prefundPayments.detail and separately reports accountFundingHold. A confirmed deposit does not establish spendability or release a hold; an internal funding adjustment does not prove a cash refund. Refused when funding is on hold, billing setup is required, the amount is outside the allowed range or the currency is not live.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amountMinor":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"artistId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"confirm":{"type":"boolean"},"currency":{"maxLength":3,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"requestId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"}},"required":["amountMinor","artistId","requestId"],"type":"object"},"name":"dynamoi_add_campaign_funds","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"propert